  "description": {
   "en": "An adaptation of Patricia A. McKillip's \"The Forgotten Beasts of Eld.\"\n\n16 years old when a baby is brought to her to raise, Sybel has grown up on Eld Mountain. Her only playmates are the creatures of a fantastic menagerie called there by wizardry. Sybel has cared nothing for humans, until the baby awakens emotions previously unknown to her. And when Coren- the man who brought this child- returns, Sybel's world is again turned upside down."
  },
